<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm home. It just finished. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Three of us examined her, so it should have been a properly objective autopsy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> really was..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">'ve already..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, never mind. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">More importantly, when </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> first found </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, her head had already been cut off, hadn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, no doubt about it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's wrong?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nothing."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But, well, there was one odd thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"On <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>'s body?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">On the right ankle, there was a mark of a strong grip."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The right ankle...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Does anything come to mind?"</STYLE><PG>
"No idea... 
{PAUSE ""}
Someone tried to pull <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> up when she was about to fall?
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE>But then she'd have been hanging upside down...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, no... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Anyway, I'll see that this doesn't leak outside. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It would be a disaster if it got out that there's a murderer inside the settlement."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
